---
---
<section id="why" class="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why</p>
    <h2>Stop losing AI resources to your notes app.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      AI learning links die in DMs, bookmarks, half-finished docs. You cannot find what worked last month. Other builders hit the same wall. This is a single place for the links that actually help.
    </p>

    <div class="why-grid">
      <article class="why-cell">
        <p class="num">01</p>
        <h3>Notes get lost</h3>
        <p>Tutorials saved across three apps, none open when you need them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="why-cell">
        <p class="num">02</p>
        <h3>Bookmarks rot</h3>
        <p>Half the links no longer resolve or describe the thing that mattered.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="why-cell">
        <p class="num">03</p>
        <h3>Builders reinvent</h3>
        <p>The same five awesome tutorials get rediscovered over and over.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .why {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .why .lede { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .why-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .why-cell {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }
  .num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--muted-2);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .why-cell h3 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
</style>
